# LCD controller modules

Project-owned colour display controller implementations built on portable
mm.mcu transports and the mm.display lifecycle interface, as modules/mm/epaper
holds the monochrome and tri-colour ones.

The difference that reaches mm.display is the pixel format, not the lifecycle:
these panels report sixteen bits per pixel and display what is written the
moment it is written, so refresh has nothing left to do.
